sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as AI client
  participant M as ZyroPay MCP
  participant S as Paid resource
  participant A as ZyroPay API
  C->>M: tools/call pay_x402 with a Bearer token
  Note over M: The token maps to one agentId. The MCP worker holds no key and no database.
  M->>S: probe the URL once for its 402 (public https, no redirects, 8 s, 64 KiB)
  S-->>M: 402 with payment requirements
  M->>A: create a transaction request (internal service token)
  A->>A: agent still active? validate, build the payload, hash it, evaluate policy
  A-->>M: PENDING_APPROVAL, or REJECTED with reason codes
  M-->>C: sanitized result inside an untrusted-data envelope
  C->>M: get_approval_status, polled until the request settles
